1411:
A. Any person desiring to practice fortunetelling or other kindred practices as defined in Section 9.48.020 shall make application for a license to the Stockbridge Police Department on forms to be prepared and approved by the mayor or his designee.
B. The applicant shall meet the following requirements prior to being licensed to practice any of the above-defined practices within the corporate limits or police jurisdiction of the city:
